{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n去韓國DAISO又有平貨掃！近日在社交平台爆紅的「DAILYCOMMA 固體香水」成為韓妹的香水焦點，有不少網民實測後激讚香氣高級，更有平替大牌Chanel 與 Jo Malone 的感覺，性價比極高！這款固體香水採用唇膏式旋轉支裝設計，十分輕巧，放進手袋完全不佔空間，不用擔心搭飛機的限制！隨時補香超方便，很貼心。全系列中以「Musk Dawn」人氣最高，柔和舒服的麝香融合清新木質調。\n</p>\n<p>另外還有優雅甜美的粉色「Dear Rose」玫瑰花香，以及沉穩中性的深色款「Velvet Wood」木質香。雖然持香度不及濃香水，但勝在價格平民又極度便攜，只需要3000韓幣，約港幣$17就能入手！去韓國玩記得衝去 DAISO 掃貨喇！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300882213587662_85838096adf24b67b83b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300882213587662_85838096adf24b67b83b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300882376889354_3823113386adf24b8343ea.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300882376889354_3823113386adf24b8343ea.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300882627411976_9736996246adf24bad49f9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300882627411976_9736996246adf24bad49f9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300882856347320_15723487426adf24bcccabd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300882856347320_15723487426adf24bcccabd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300883038173986_19391122746adf24bec3187.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300883038173986_19391122746adf24bec3187.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300883216812937_11041889266adf24c07283f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179300883216812937_11041889266adf24c07283f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De81e4akq6H/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:20:29.065995+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":444,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:28.580580+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:18:22.867611+00:00","content_hash":"643e9013fdf909a109aded49fe0a389713c3036a45970a5faafa20e425db61ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}